---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const values=[
 {title:'Outcomes Over Activity',body:'We measure success by the business results customers achieve, not by volume of features or activity.'},
 {title:'Reliability as a Feature',body:'Enterprise execution must be dependable, repeatable, observable, and accountable.'},
 {title:'Security by Default',body:'Encryption, role-based access, governance, and auditability are foundational design requirements.'},
 {title:'Built for the Long Run',body:'We value durable customer relationships, thoughtful execution, and platforms that can grow with the organization.'}
];
---
<BaseLayout title="About Oryele | Experienced Leadership, Enterprise Execution" description="Meet Oryele and learn about our mission, leadership, and operating principles.">
<section class="co-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">About Oryele</p><h1>Experienced leadership.<br/>A new standard for execution.</h1><p>Oryele is building an enterprise execution platform that connects people, process, communications, knowledge, governance, analytics, and AI in one accountable operating environment.</p></div></section>
<section class="story"><div class="wrap story-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p><h2>Make complex organizations easier to run.</h2><p>Organizations lose time and value when work is fragmented across inboxes, documents, meetings, applications, and informal follow-up. Oryele creates a governed execution layer that turns operating intent into consistent action.</p><p>We combine digital workers, workflow orchestration, communications, knowledge, governance, and analytics so teams can move faster without losing oversight, security, or accountability.</p></div><div class="values">{values.map(v=><article><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="leadership"><div class="wrap leader-grid"><figure class="portrait"><img src="/assets/lawrence-nadjafian-transparent-v22.png?v=22" alt="Lawrence Nadjafian, Co-Founder and CEO of Oryele" width="665" height="847" loading="eager" decoding="sync"/></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p><h2>Led by Lawrence Nadjafian</h2><p>Oryele is led by Co-Founder and CEO Lawrence Nadjafian, an experienced business executive with a background spanning finance, investment, strategic management, corporate governance, and operational leadership.</p><p>Across executive and board roles, Lawrence has focused on company growth, business development, organizational oversight, strategic initiatives, and the practical disciplines required to scale a business responsibly. That experience shapes Oryele's emphasis on measurable outcomes, governance, transparency, and enterprise-grade execution.</p><p>He leads a team of highly experienced individuals who bring together operating, commercial, financial, product, and technology expertise. The team's shared objective is to build software that is ambitious in capability, disciplined in operation, and valuable in the real world.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="team"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Our team</p><h2>Built by operators, technologists, and problem solvers.</h2><p>Our team understands that enterprise transformation is not achieved by automation alone. It requires process clarity, change leadership, data discipline, security, and a deep appreciation for how people actually work. We design Oryele around those realities.</p><div class="team-grid"><article><b>Operational experience</b><span>Practical understanding of execution, accountability, scaling, and customer delivery.</span></article><article><b>Technology expertise</b><span>Modern AI, workflow, communications, knowledge, analytics, and secure platform engineering.</span></article><article><b>Governance mindset</b><span>Controls, evidence, transparency, and responsible deployment are built into the product philosophy.</span></article></div></div></section>
<section class="final"><div class="wrap"><h2>Build a more intelligent operating model.</h2><p>See how Oryele can connect your people, systems, knowledge, and workflows.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/contact/">Request a Demo →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.co-hero{padding-block:clamp(70px,8vw,110px);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),#102f68);color:#fff}.co-hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,5.2vw,68px);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 24px}.co-hero p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:780px;color:#c8d5e8;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7}.story,.leadership,.team{padding-block:clamp(65px,7vw,100px)}.story-grid,.leader-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:start}h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);margin:0 0 22px}.story p,.leadership p,.team>div>p{color:#33415a;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.values article,.team-grid article{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:23px;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)}.values h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px}.values p{margin:0;font-size:14px}.leadership{background:var(--paper-2);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.leader-grid{grid-template-columns:300px minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center}.portrait{margin:0;width:260px;max-width:100%;justify-self:start;background:#fff;border-radius:0;overflow:visible;box-shadow:none;border:0}.portrait img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:transparent;filter:none}.team{text-align:center}.team>div>p{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 35px}.team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;text-align:left}.team-grid article{display:grid;gap:10px}.team-grid b{font-size:17px}.team-grid span{color:#465570;line-height:1.6}.final{text-align:center;padding-block:80px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.final h2{margin-bottom:12px}.final p{color:#c7d3e5;margin:0 0 26px}
@media(max-width:850px){.story-grid,.leader-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.values,.team-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.portrait{width:260px;max-width:100%;justify-self:center}}
</style>
